 "title": "Welcome to Dickinson County, MI",
 "text": "Welcome to Dickinson County, MI\nHome\nGovernment\nCounty Services\nDickinson County Library\nDickinson County Fair\nHealth Department\nHospital Healthcare System\nRoad Commission\nConstruction Code\nFord Airport (IMT)\nVeterans Affairs\nMSU Extension\nCounty Departments\nBoard of Commissioners*\nCounty Controller\nCounty Court System\nCounty Clerk*\nRegister of Deeds*\nCounty Treasurer*\nEqualization\nSheriff's Department*\nLake Antoine Park/Campground\nDrain Commissioner*\nResidents\nLocal Area Information\nCities And Townships\nLocal Schools\nPublic Library and branches\nFor Pets and Wildlife\nRecreation\nTourist Information\nCounty Links\nCounty History Development\nCourthouse\nDemographic Information\nElected Officials\nFinancial Dashboard\nElections\nVoter Information\nEducation\nHealthCare\nSenior Citizens\nMilitary Veterans\nWelcome\nCities And Townships\nTourist Information\nRecreation\nBusiness\nCounty records information\nDemographic Information\nEmployment Opportunities\nHow Do I\nPay fines\nApply For\nAssumed Name DBAs\nBirth Certificates\nConcealed Weapons Licenses\nDeath Certificates\nDivorces\nMarriage Licenses\nEmployment Opportunities\nContact\nUseful Phone Numbers\nBoard Meeting Minutes\nRecording Documents\nFind Information On\nGo\nPrev Next\nRecording Documents\nHome Government County Departments Register of Deeds Recording Documents\nSub Menu\nRegister of Deeds Information links\nRecording Documents\nMichigan Transfer Tax Exemptions\nDickinson County Transfer Tax Exemptions\nRegister Of Deeds Online Search\nMichigan Real Estate Transfer\nRecording Information: Effective posting June 4, 2025\nRequirements\nRecording fees: Effective October 1, 2016 in the State of Michigan\nRegardless of the number of pages, all documents will cost $30 to record, this cost is inclusive of Mich. remonumentation and Register of Deeds Automation fees.\nFor a document that assigns or discharges more than 1 instrument $3.00 for each instrument assigned or discharged (in addition to the $30 flat fee)\nTo certify a recorded document $5.00, copies remain at $1 per page and search fees remain at 50 cents for each year searched with a minimum of $5.00- excepting tract index searches, contact your local register\nWarranty deeds and land contracts require an additional $5 for certification by the Treasurer.\nThe transfer tax rates for Deeds & Easements with consideration of $100 or more are computed at:\n$1.10 per $1,000 for Dickinson County, and $7.50 per $1,000 for the State of Michigan.\nUCC/Fixture Filing: $30.00 Flat Fee\nnon-standard form charge: additional $7.00 per form.\nRecording services\nCorporation Service Company (CSC)\nIndecomm Global Services\nCounty Departments\nBoard Of Commissioners\nCounty Controller\nCounty Clerk\nRegister Of Deeds\nCounty Treasurer\nEqualization\nCounty Departments\nSheriff's Department\nParks\nFord Airport\nProsecuting Attorney\nCourt System\nQuicklinks\nContact information\nElections\nCalendar\nParks & Rec\nBirth, Death & Marriage Records\nTaxes\nTraffic Tickets\nSmall Claims\nMeeting Minutes & Agendas\nEmployment Opportunities\nPassport Information\nCounty Committee application for public\nContact Us\n705 S. Stephenson Ave.\nIron Mountain MI 49801\nMailing Address\nPO Box 609\nIron Mountain MI 49801\npowered by revize. , The Government Website Experts. |\nLogin\nSHARE\n×\nShare this page\nCopy and paste this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://www.dickinsoncountymi.gov/government/county_departments/register_of_deeds/recording_documents.php\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nGoogle Plus\nReddit\nClose",
